explanation:
Syntax of PL/SQL Loop is –
LOOP
Sequence of statements;
END LOOP;

The correct syntax of WHILE Loop is –
WHILE <condition>
LOOP statements; 
END LOOP;

The correct syntax to declare explicit cursor is –
CURSOR name IS
SELECT statement;
